  "notes": [
    "All image bytes are unchanged copies of the source ZIP members.",
    "UI Adventure pack has no dedicated pressed-button image. Use its normal button with CSS translate/brightness; button-close contains an X and is not a pressed state.",
    "Sci-fi raised/depth and flat rectangle sources are provided as normal and pressed visual variants; their original member names remain recorded.",
    "Loading previews inspected: usable illustrations on dark backgrounds, but both contain a Kenney license/branding footer. Frame/crop intentionally in the final composition.",
    "Terrain pack author states most images tile seamlessly; validate selected seams and alpha-mask layout in the renderer.",
    "DevEarley texture ZIPs did not contain a license file; their explicit sourcepage CC0 declaration is preserved as an original provenance record."
  ],
